{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Eri8F1uHniia45yBudFvdh","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"vitest CLI --repeats option\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"main.vitest.dev\",\"url\":\"https://main.vitest.dev/config/repeats\"},{\"title\":\"next.tangled.org\",\"url\":\"https://next.tangled.org/vitest.dev/vitest/blob/main/docs/config/repeats.md\"},{\"title\":\"github.com\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/blob/46dc57156700ebd5d9d99fc4c5e4180614984f27/docs/guide/cli.md\"},{\"title\":\"github.com\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/blob/43fa6baa6d10fe4363dc06a1af2da52d5746dd4c/docs/guide/cli.md\"},{\"title\":\"github.com\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/Aslemammad/vitest/blob/5958d75d3c4bb5b2ccfead937ed05657cfb857db/docs/guide/cli.md\"},{\"title\":\"Command Line Interface\",\"url\":\"https://v0.vitest.dev/guide/cli\"},{\"title\":\"next.tangled.org\",\"url\":\"https://next.tangled.org/vitest.dev/vitest/blob/v1/docs/guide/cli.md\"},{\"title\":\"next.tangled.org\",\"url\":\"https://next.tangled.org/vitest.dev/vitest/blob/v0/docs/guide/cli.md\"},{\"title\":\"next.tangled.org\",\"url\":\"https://next.tangled.org/vitest.dev/vitest/blob/v2/docs/guide/cli.md\"}]\n\nThe `--repeats` flag is documented as a config option with a CLI form, `--repeats=<number>`. Per the official config reference (default 0), it runs each test a set number of times regardless of outcome. A test that sets its own repeats option overrides this value.\n\nThe docs also say that a single failing repetition marks the whole test as failed, which makes the flag useful for checking flaky tests. Verifying that tests are stable across multiple runs is its main use, and any failure on any repetition fails the test.\n\nThe CLI reference pages I found don't list `--repeats` in their options tables, so the config page is the main source. Search results also included mirror copies of the same docs, which show the same details.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e844aed-6d69-40c2-80d7-902479bbb6e1","uuid":"11c28d6c-bc5e-47d3-9ff3-f9aa10a7fd3d","timestamp":"2026-10-11T10:46:39.136Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"vitest CLI --repeats option","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_012F5yukBLiSp2UpV9uRgm1w","content":[{"title":"main.vitest.dev","url":"https://main.vitest.dev/config/repeats"},{"title":"next.tangled.org","url":"https://next.tangled.org/vitest.dev/vitest/blob/main/docs/config/repeats.md"},{"title":"github.com","url":"https://github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/blob/46dc57156700ebd5d9d99fc4c5e4180614984f27/docs/guide/cli.md"},{"title":"github.com","url":"https://github.com/vitest-dev/vitest/blob/43fa6baa6d10fe4363dc06a1af2da52d5746dd4c/docs/guide/cli.md"},{"title":"github.com","url":"https://github.com/Aslemammad/vitest/blob/5958d75d3c4bb5b2ccfead937ed05657cfb857db/docs/guide/cli.md"},{"title":"Command Line Interface","url":"https://v0.vitest.dev/guide/cli"},{"title":"next.tangled.org","url":"https://next.tangled.org/vitest.dev/vitest/blob/v1/docs/guide/cli.md"},{"title":"next.tangled.org","url":"https://next.tangled.org/vitest.dev/vitest/blob/v0/docs/guide/cli.md"},{"title":"next.tangled.org","url":"https://next.tangled.org/vitest.dev/vitest/blob/v2/docs/guide/cli.md"}]},"The `--repeats` flag is documented as a config option with a CLI form, `--repeats=<number>`. Per the official config reference (default 0), it runs each test a set number of times regardless of outcome. A test that sets its own repeats option overrides this value.\n\nThe docs also say that a single failing repetition marks the whole test as failed, which makes the flag useful for checking flaky tests. Verifying that tests are stable across multiple runs is its main use, and any failure on any repetition fails the test.\n\nThe CLI reference pages I found don't list `--repeats` in their options tables, so the config page is the main source. Search results also included mirror copies of the same docs, which show the same details."],"durationSeconds":3.7974076000000005,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Eri8F1uHniia45yBudFvdh","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
